      "id": 119491,
      "name": "UXM266",
      "username": "UXM266",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/uxm266/{size}/1966_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-10-22T19:51:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Sefirit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e68b1a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Sefirit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>What I want to know is how well it fits sleeved cards.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>From their kickstarter page: <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/1144387021/board-game-storage-chests-tokens-inserts-and-more\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/1144387021/board-game-storage-chests-tokens-inserts-and-more</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>\"Some designs are so space constrained that your sleeving choices will be restricted (hint: Ultra Pro Standard and Mayday Standard will always work with any of our inserts), \"</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>From their website: <a href=\"http://go7gaming.com/sleeving-cards-our-inserts/\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Sleeving Cards &amp; Our Inserts – Go7Gaming</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>\"Bottom Line: If you sleeve using Ultra Pro Deck Protectors/Standard/Pro Fit, Mayday Premium, or KMC you can stop reading now. &nbsp;Your cards will store fine in any of our inserts and storage chests. \"</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Hope this helps!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>NOTE: I do not work for, nor have I ever bought from the site. I only discoevred this through research. I have no clue on the qwuality, but reviews seem to eb positive.&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:52:41.487Z",
